    {
      "id": "1536018778230493275",
      "type": "Default",
      "timestamp": "2026-08-09T14:30:14.579+00:00",
      "timestampEdited": null,
      "callEndedTimestamp": null,
      "isPinned": false,
      "content": "Change from previous PCBs: \n- No vias or though holes in enclosed area (under the epoxy glob) \n- Made pins on the mezzanine longer, bumped to `0.8` mm to help SMD soldering, we might want to make this even longer. The coordinates of the mezzanine footprint pins have not changed so this change should have no effect for the pick-and-pace. \n\nNo changes: \n- part positions: mezzanine, die footprint and SMD capacitors are all at exactly the same place\n\nThings we might want to change: \n- No fill zone in the encapsulation region \n\nThings I want to change:\n- constant bonding wire length from die to finger\n- more gradual angle changes in bonder trajectory (seem to not handle abrusc transitions very well, see corners )\n- length match signal wire or at least attempt to have them closer in cumulative length.",
      "author": {
        "id": "509798510170865675",
        "name": "essen__",
        "discriminator": "0000",
        "nickname": "Essen",
        "color": null,
        "isBot": false,
        "roles": [],
        "avatarUrl": "2026-08_media/80e086280c9caadd9c05998c3254c9a9-25B3D.png"
      },
      "attachments": [],
      "embeds": [],
      "stickers": [],
      "reactions": [],
      "mentions": [],
      "inlineEmojis": []
    },
